cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "HeteroServe: code and data"
abstract: >-
  An experimental characterisation study of where the prefill, decode and layers of a large language model should run
  across a cluster of heterogeneous low-cost devices (a ThinkPad T580 laptop, a Raspberry Pi 5, a Raspberry Pi 4 and a
  Jetson Nano, pooled with llama.cpp RPC) to optimise latency, throughput and energy per token together. Every study is
  registered before it runs, and every published result can be re-derived from the raw data.
type: software
